      "doc": "docs/concepts/FONT-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "font",
      "kind": "term",
      "line": 123,
      "obj_id": "font:term:font handle",
      "text": "`&'static dyn FontMetrics` — the borrow a widget holds to draw glyphs. Fat pointer; `'static` so widgets need no lifetime parameter."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "relationship": "FONT-00 §5",
        "term": "`WidgetFont`"
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/FONT-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "font",
      "kind": "term",
      "line": 124,
      "obj_id": "font:term:`widgetfont`",
      "text": "The frozen newtype `WidgetFont(Option<&'static dyn FontMetrics>)` embedded in text widgets; `resolve()` returns the assigned handle or the `FONT_6X10` fallback."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "relationship": "FONT-00 §5",
        "term": "`set_font`"
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/FONT-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "font",
      "kind": "term",
      "line": 125,
      "obj_id": "font:term:`set_font`",
      "text": "The uniform widget method `fn set_font(&mut self, font: &'static dyn FontMetrics)` (mirrors `ArcLabel`). Assigns the handle."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "relationship": "LPAR-08 / `core/src/font.rs`",
        "term": "Coverage"
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/FONT-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "font",
      "kind": "term",
      "line": 126,
      "obj_id": "font:term:coverage",
      "text": "Per-pixel A8 alpha (`0..=255`) for a glyph, pulled row-wise via `FontMetrics::glyph_coverage_row`."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "relationship": "FONT-00 §6",
        "term": "1-bit font"
      },
      "doc": "docs/concepts/FONT-00-CONCEPTS.md",
      "family": "font",
      "kind": "term",
      "line": 127,
      "obj_id": "font:term:1-bit font",
      "text": "A `FontMetrics` whose coverage is only `0` or `255` (e.g. `FONT_6X10`). Crisp, not anti-aliased."
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "relationship": "FONT-00 §6",
        "term": "AA font"
